{"candidate_ids": [], "chapter_number": 1, "locally_named_context_leads": [], "no_ambient_hypotheses_inferred": true, "omitted_proof_line_count": 0, "possible_scope_prose_line_numbers": [], "previous_draft_artifact_hint": null, "proof_free_source_lines": [{"line": 28, "tex": "\\section{Overview}"}, {"line": 29, "tex": "\\label{section-overview}"}, {"line": 31, "tex": "\\noindent"}, {"line": 32, "tex": "Besides the book by Laumon and Moret-Bailly, see \\cite{LM-B}, and the work"}, {"line": 33, "tex": "(in progress) by Fulton et al, we think there is a place for an open source"}, {"line": 34, "tex": "textbook on algebraic stacks and the algebraic geometry that is needed"}, {"line": 35, "tex": "to define them. The Stacks Project attempts to do this by building the"}, {"line": 36, "tex": "foundations starting with commutative algebra and proceeding via the"}, {"line": 37, "tex": "theory of schemes and algebraic spaces to a comprehensive foundation for"}, {"line": 38, "tex": "the theory of algebraic stacks."}, {"line": 40, "tex": "\\medskip\\noindent"}, {"line": 41, "tex": "We expect this material to be read online as a key feature are the hyperlinks"}, {"line": 42, "tex": "giving quick access to internal references spread over many different pages."}, {"line": 43, "tex": "If you use an embedded pdf or dvi viewer in your browser, the cross file"}, {"line": 44, "tex": "links should work."}, {"line": 46, "tex": "\\medskip\\noindent"}, {"line": 47, "tex": "This project is a collaborative effort and we encourage you to help out."}, {"line": 48, "tex": "Please email any typos or errors you find while reading or"}, {"line": 49, "tex": "any suggestions, additional material, or examples you have to"}, {"line": 50, "tex": "\\href{mailto:stacks.project@gmail.com}{stacks.project@gmail.com}."}, {"line": 51, "tex": "You can download a tarball containing all source files, extract,"}, {"line": 52, "tex": "run make, and use a dvi or pdf viewer locally. Please feel free to"}, {"line": 53, "tex": "edit the LaTeX files and email your improvements."}], "schema": "maththm.phase2.chapter-section-input.v1", "scope_extraction_error_requires_review": null, "section_end_line": 55, "section_label": "section-overview", "section_start_line": 28, "section_title": "Overview", "source_file": "introduction.tex", "source_revision": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_scope_events_unadjudicated": []}
{"candidate_ids": [], "chapter_number": 1, "locally_named_context_leads": [], "no_ambient_hypotheses_inferred": true, "omitted_proof_line_count": 0, "possible_scope_prose_line_numbers": [], "previous_draft_artifact_hint": null, "proof_free_source_lines": [{"line": 56, "tex": "\\section{Attribution}"}, {"line": 57, "tex": "\\label{section-attribution}"}, {"line": 59, "tex": "\\noindent"}, {"line": 60, "tex": "The scope of this work is such that it is a daunting task to attribute"}, {"line": 61, "tex": "correctly and succinctly all of those mathematicians whose work has led"}, {"line": 62, "tex": "to the development of the theory we try to explain here. We hope eventually"}, {"line": 63, "tex": "to generate enough community interest to find contributors willing to write"}, {"line": 64, "tex": "sections with historical remarks for each and every chapter."}, {"line": 66, "tex": "\\medskip\\noindent"}, {"line": 67, "tex": "Those who contributed to this work are listed on the title page of the book"}, {"line": 68, "tex": "version of this work and"}, {"line": 69, "tex": "\\href{https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tex/CONTRIBUTORS}{online}."}, {"line": 70, "tex": "Here we would like to name a selection of major contributions:"}, {"line": 71, "tex": "\\begin{enumerate}"}, {"line": 72, "tex": "\\item Jarod Alper contributed a chapter discussing the literature"}, {"line": 73, "tex": "on algebraic stacks, see"}, {"line": 74, "tex": "Guide to Literature, Section \\ref{guide-section-short-introductions}."}, {"line": 75, "tex": "\\item Bhargav Bhatt wrote the initial version of a chapter"}, {"line": 76, "tex": "on \\'etale morphisms of schemes, see"}, {"line": 77, "tex": "\\'Etale Morphisms, Section \\ref{etale-section-introduction}."}, {"line": 78, "tex": "\\item Bhargav Bhatt wrote the initial version of"}, {"line": 79, "tex": "More on Algebra, Section \\ref{more-algebra-section-formal-glueing}."}, {"line": 80, "tex": "\\item Kiran Kedlaya contributed the initial writeup of"}, {"line": 81, "tex": "Descent, Section \\ref{descent-section-descent-universally-injective}."}, {"line": 82, "tex": "\\item The initial versions of"}, {"line": 83, "tex": "\\begin{enumerate}"}, {"line": 84, "tex": "\\item Algebra, Section \\ref{algebra-section-oka-families},"}, {"line": 85, "tex": "\\item Injectives, Section \\ref{injectives-section-baer}, and"}, {"line": 86, "tex": "\\item the chapter on fields, see"}, {"line": 87, "tex": "Fields, Section \\ref{fields-section-introduction}."}, {"line": 88, "tex": "\\end{enumerate}"}, {"line": 89, "tex": "are from"}, {"line": 90, "tex": "\\href{https://math.uchicago.edu/~amathew/cr.html}{The CRing Project},"}, {"line": 91, "tex": "courtesy of Akhil Mathew et al."}, {"line": 92, "tex": "\\item Alex Perry wrote the material on projective modules,"}, {"line": 93, "tex": "Mittag-Leffler modules, including the proof of"}, {"line": 94, "tex": "Algebra, Theorem \\ref{algebra-theorem-ffdescent-projectivity}."}, {"line": 95, "tex": "\\item Alex Perry wrote the chapter on deformation theory a la Schlessinger"}, {"line": 96, "tex": "and Rim, see"}, {"line": 97, "tex": "Formal Deformation Theory, Section \\ref{formal-defos-section-introduction}."}, {"line": 98, "tex": "\\item Thibaut Pugin, Zachary Maddock and Min Lee took notes for"}, {"line": 99, "tex": "a course which formed the basis for a chapter on \\'etale cohomology"}, {"line": 100, "tex": "and a chapter on the trace formula. See"}, {"line": 101, "tex": "\\'Etale Cohomology, Section \\ref{etale-cohomology-section-introduction}"}, {"line": 102, "tex": "and"}, {"line": 103, "tex": "The Trace Formula, Section \\ref{trace-section-introduction}."}, {"line": 104, "tex": "\\item David Rydh has contributed many helpful comments, pointed out several"}, {"line": 105, "tex": "mistakes, helped out in an essential way with the material on residual gerbes,"}, {"line": 106, "tex": "and was the originator for the material in"}, {"line": 107, "tex": "More on Groupoids in Spaces, Sections"}, {"line": 108, "tex": "\\ref{spaces-more-groupoids-section-finite} and"}, {"line": 109, "tex": "\\ref{spaces-more-groupoids-section-etale-localize}."}, {"line": 110, "tex": "\\item Burt Totaro contributed Examples, Sections"}, {"line": 111, "tex": "\\ref{examples-section-non-descending-property-projective},"}, {"line": 112, "tex": "\\ref{examples-section-non-effective-descent-projective},"}, {"line": 113, "tex": "and"}, {"line": 114, "tex": "Properties of Stacks, Section \\ref{stacks-properties-section-dimension}."}, {"line": 115, "tex": "\\item The chapter on pro-\\'etale cohomology, see"}, {"line": 116, "tex": "Pro-\\'etale Cohomology, Section \\ref{proetale-section-introduction},"}, {"line": 117, "tex": "is taken from a paper by Bhargav Bhatt and Peter Scholze."}, {"line": 118, "tex": "\\item Bhargav Bhatt contributed Examples, Sections"}, {"line": 119, "tex": "\\ref{examples-section-non-algebraic-hom-stack} and"}, {"line": 120, "tex": "\\ref{examples-section-flat-not-colimit-flat-finitely-presented}."}, {"line": 121, "tex": "\\item Ofer Gabber found mistakes, contributed corrections and he"}, {"line": 122, "tex": "contributed"}, {"line": 123, "tex": "Varieties, Lemma \\ref{varieties-lemma-image-connected-component},"}, {"line": 124, "tex": "Formal Spaces, Lemma \\ref{formal-spaces-lemma-completion-countably-indexed},"}, {"line": 125, "tex": "the material in"}, {"line": 126, "tex": "More on Groupoids, Section \\ref{more-groupoids-section-ind-quasi-affine},"}, {"line": 127, "tex": "the main result of"}, {"line": 128, "tex": "Properties of Spaces, Section \\ref{spaces-properties-section-fpqc},"}, {"line": 129, "tex": "and the proof of"}, {"line": 130, "tex": "More on Flatness, Proposition"}, {"line": 131, "tex": "\\ref{flat-proposition-finite-type-injective-into-flat-mod-m}."}, {"line": 132, "tex": "\\item J\\'anos Koll\\'ar contributed"}, {"line": 133, "tex": "Algebra, Lemma \\ref{algebra-lemma-hart-serre-loc-thm} and"}, {"line": 134, "tex": "Local Cohomology, Proposition \\ref{local-cohomology-proposition-kollar}."}, {"line": 135, "tex": "\\item Kiran Kedlaya wrote the initial version of"}, {"line": 136, "tex": "More on Algebra, Section \\ref{more-algebra-section-beauville-laszlo}."}, {"line": 137, "tex": "\\item Matthew Emerton, Toby Gee, and Brandon Levin contributed"}, {"line": 138, "tex": "some results on thickenings, in particular"}, {"line": 139, "tex": "More on Morphisms of Stacks, Lemmas"}, {"line": 140, "tex": "\\ref{stacks-more-morphisms-lemma-reduced-diagonal},"}, {"line": 141, "tex": "\\ref{stacks-more-morphisms-lemma-thickening-diagonals}, and"}, {"line": 142, "tex": "\\ref{stacks-more-morphisms-lemma-thickening-properties}."}, {"line": 143, "tex": "\\item Lena Min Ji wrote the initial version of"}, {"line": 144, "tex": "More on Algebra, Section \\ref{more-algebra-section-principal-radical-ideals}."}, {"line": 145, "tex": "\\item Matthew Emerton and Toby Gee wrote the initial versions of"}, {"line": 146, "tex": "Geometry of Stacks,"}, {"line": 147, "tex": "Sections \\ref{stacks-geometry-section-multiplicities} and"}, {"line": 148, "tex": "\\ref{stacks-geometry-section-dimension-of-algebraic-stacks}."}, {"line": 149, "tex": "\\end{enumerate}"}, {"line": 153, "tex": "\\input{chapters}"}, {"line": 155, "tex": "\\bibliography{my}"}, {"line": 156, "tex": "\\bibliographystyle{amsalpha}"}, {"line": 158, "tex": "\\end{document}"}], "schema": "maththm.phase2.chapter-section-input.v1", "scope_extraction_error_requires_review": null, "section_end_line": 158, "section_label": "section-attribution", "section_start_line": 56, "section_title": "Attribution", "source_file": "introduction.tex", "source_revision": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_scope_events_unadjudicated": []}
